[{"id":165095086,"discussion_id":"22b24c47b6ca70cb427f37193240531fba66695b","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-12T19:35:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-12T19:35:48+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165095193,"discussion_id":"b1a2adabb0451480379d48a9edc3a20d07b03a2d","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复了All-to-All矩阵乘法算子在启用SmoothQuant功能时，用于存储量化后数据的UB内存布局计算错误。该错误可能导致后续内存访问越界或数据错位，影响量化过程的正确性和算子运行的稳定性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改了`QuantToken`函数中UB内存偏移量的计算方式。核心是将`smoothScaleCastOffset`变量的对齐方式从`Block32B<ATType>::AlignDown`改为`Block32B<ATType>::AlignUp`，并将第二个缓冲区`copyTensor1`的初始化方式从基于`smoothScaleTensor`的偏移改为基于`copyTensor0`的偏移。这两处修改确保了在SmoothQuant场景下，用于存储量化中间结果的UB内存区域地址计算正确，避免了潜在的内存重叠或访问错误。","created_at":"2026-03-12T19:36:18+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-12T19:36:18+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165159887,"discussion_id":"0aec3c2a02a9b730951c09a1e807640e34374c34","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/can